India is massively privatizing [[airports]], ports, [[Inter-State Bus Terminals|bus stands]], [[railway stations]], [[dams]], [[wind park|dam wind park]],<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.power-technology.com/data-insights/power-plant-profile-kseb-kerala-dam-wind-farm-india/ |title=Power plant profile: KSEB- Kerala Dam Wind Farm, India |work=Power Technology |date=27 April 2023 |author1=Kgi-Admin |access-date=10 November 2024 |archive-date=10 November 2024 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20241110143223/https://www.power-technology.com/data-insights/power-plant-profile-kseb-kerala-dam-wind-farm-india/ |url-status=dead }}</ref> [[Photovoltaic power station|solar parks]], [[Floating solar|floating solar plants]], [[power transmission]], [[highways]], [[thermal power]] and other utilizes.

=== Finance and trade ===
